| | | | `-TextComment 0x326f5420 <col:3, col:18> Text="     routine(a);"
| | | |-ParagraphComment 0x326f54c0 <line:52:3, line:53:71>
| | | | |-TextComment 0x326f5470 <line:52:3, col:98> Text=" A word of caution when working with initializer_list, initializer_lists have a lifetime that is"
