| |   |-TextComment 0x32750cf0 <line:24:1, col:79> Text="    objects. When an existing owner wants to share a reference, it calls ref()."
| |   |-TextComment 0x32750d10 <line:25:1, col:76> Text="    When an owner wants to release its reference, it calls unref(). When the"
| |   |-TextComment 0x32750d30 <line:26:1, col:76> Text="    shared object's reference count goes to zero as the result of an unref()"
