  | |-ParagraphComment 0x327664a0 <line:41:4>
  | | `-TextComment 0x32766470 <col:4> Text=" "
  | |-VerbatimLineComment 0x327664c0 <col:5, col:18> Text=" SkPath"
  | |-ParagraphComment 0x327665d0 <line:42:1, line:46:79>
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766500 <line:42:1, col:83> Text="    SkPath contain geometry. SkPath may be empty, or contain one or more verbs that"
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766520 <line:43:1, col:86> Text="    outline a figure. SkPath always starts with a move verb to a Cartesian coordinate,"
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766540 <line:44:1, col:69> Text="    and may be followed by additional verbs that add lines or curves."
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766560 <line:45:1, col:84> Text="    Adding a close verb makes the geometry into a continuous loop, a closed contour."
  | | `-TextComment 0x32766580 <line:46:1, col:79> Text="    SkPath may contain any number of contours, each beginning with a move verb."
  | |-ParagraphComment 0x32766670 <line:48:1, line:50:11>
  | | |-TextComment 0x327665f0 <line:48:1, col:76> Text="    SkPath contours may contain only a move verb, or may also contain lines,"
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766610 <line:49:1, col:80> Text="    quadratic beziers, conics, and cubic beziers. SkPath contours may be open or"
  | | `-TextComment 0x32766630 <line:50:1, col:11> Text="    closed."
  | |-ParagraphComment 0x32766710 <line:52:1, line:54:25>
  | | |-TextComment 0x32766690 <line:52:1, col:83> Text="    When used to draw a filled area, SkPath describes whether the fill is inside or"
  | | |-TextComment 0x327666b0 <line:53:1, col:77> Text="    outside the geometry. SkPath also describes the winding rule used to fill"
  | | `-TextComment 0x327666d0 <line:54:1, col:25> Text="    overlapping contours."
  | `-ParagraphComment 0x32766780 <line:56:1, line:57:57>
  |   |-TextComment 0x32766730 <line:56:1, col:79> Text="    Internally, SkPath lazily computes metrics likes bounds and convexity. Call"
  |   `-TextComment 0x32766750 <line:57:1, col:57> Text="    SkPath::updateBoundsCache to make SkPath thread safe."
  |-CXXRecordDecl 0x32388818 <line:59:1, col:14> col:14 implicit referenced class SkPath
