  |   | `-TextComment 0x32766890 <col:7, col:88> Text="  The points and weights arrays are read in order, based on the sequence of verbs."
  |   |-ParagraphComment 0x327669d0 <line:66:7, line:71:24>
  |   | |-TextComment 0x327668e0 <line:66:7, col:23> Text="  Move    1 point"
